### sample items (legacy)
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/items

### ping / liveness
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/ping

### bulk feed (large product list for load/aggregation; Item-1..Item-{size}, random stock)
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/bulk?size=200

### bulk feed — fault injection (returns HTTP 500)
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/bulk?fail=true

### reserve stock (checkout chain hop 1): atomic check-and-decrement + price quote.
# 400 blank sku / qty<=0, 404 unknown sku, 409 insufficient stock (no decrement)
POST https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "CAT-1",
  "quantity": 2
}

### list all products
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog

### get one product
GET https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/CAT-1

### create product
POST https://localhost:8081/api/catalog
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Stapler",
  "category": "Office",
  "price": 12.90,
  "stock": 30
}

### update product
PUT https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/CAT-2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 1.50,
  "stock": 450
}

### delete product
DELETE https://localhost:8081/api/catalog/CAT-2

### secondary instance
GET https://localhost:8082/api/catalog/items
